  "historyNote": "#6651, eff 12-10-97; ss by #6980, eff 4-21-99, EXPIRED: 4-21-07 New. #8978, INTERIM, eff 9-14-07, EXPIRES: 3-12-08; ss by #9043-A, eff 11-29-07",
